#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:359
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WelcomeToBattleArena"
msgid ""
"Where the battling spirit of TRAINERS\n"
"is put to the test!\p"
"I welcome you to the BATTLE ARENA!\p"
"I am your guide to the Set KO Tourney!$"
msgstr ""
"考验训练家斗志的地方！\p"
"欢迎来到对战竞技场！\p"
"我是淘汰赛的向导！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:365
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WishToTakeChallenge"
msgid ""
"Now, do you wish to take\n"
"the BATTLE ARENA challenge?$"
msgstr ""
"那么，你要挑战\n"
"对战竞技场吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:369
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr "我们期待你下次的挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:373
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainChallenge"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE ARENA, we undertake\n"
"the Set KO Tourney.\p"
"All participants enter with a team of\n"
"three POKéMON.\p"
"The three POKéMON must be lined up in\n"
"the order in which they are to appear.\p"
"During battle, the POKéMON will appear\n"
"one at a time in the preset order.\p"
"Once a POKéMON enters battle, it must\n"
"remain out until the match is decided.\p"
"If a match remains undecided in\n"
"three turns, it goes to judging.\p"
"If you wish to interrupt your challenge,\n"
"please save the game.\p"
"If you don't save, you will not be able\n"
"to continue with your challenge.\p"
"If you pull off the feat of beating\n"
"seven TRAINERS in succession,\l"
"we will present you with Battle Points.$"
msgstr ""
"在对战竞技场，\n"
"我们举办的是淘汰赛。\p"
"所有参赛者都要\n"
"带着3只宝可梦参加。\p"
"这3只宝可梦必须\n"
"按照出场的顺序排好。\p"
"对战中，宝可梦会按照\n"
"预先排好的顺序逐一出场。\p"
"宝可梦一旦出场，\n"
"就必须一直战斗到分出胜负。\p"
"如果3回合内还没有分出胜负，\n"
"就会进入裁判判定。\p"
"如果想中断挑战，\n"
"请记录游戏进度。\p"
"如果不记录，\n"
"就无法继续挑战了。\p"
"如果能连续打败7位训练家，\n"
"我们会送你对战点数。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:394
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_OkayToSave"
msgid ""
"Before showing you to the BATTLE\n"
"ARENA, you must save. Is that okay?$"
msgstr ""
"带你去对战竞技场之前，\n"
"必须先记录。可以吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:398
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_WhichLevelMode"
msgid ""
"The BATTLE ARENA offers two levels\n"
"of challenge, Level 50 and Open Level.\l"
"Which is your choice?$"
msgstr ""
"对战竞技场的挑战有两种等级：\n"
"Lv.50和自由等级。\l"
"你要选哪一种？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:403
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_SelectThreeMons"
msgid ""
"Very well, now select your\n"
"three POKéMON, please.$"
msgstr ""
"很好，那么请选择\n"
"你的3只宝可梦。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:407
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLvOpen"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你没有参赛所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参赛，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:417
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsEnd"
msgid ""
"When you have made your preparations,\n"
"please do return.$"
msgstr ""
"准备好之后，\n"
"请再回来吧。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:421
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_NotEnoughValidMonsLv50"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You do not have the three POKéMON\n"
"required for entry.\p"
"To qualify, you must bring three\n"
"different kinds of POKéMON.\p"
"The three different POKéMON\n"
"must all be Level 50 or lower.\p"
"They also must not hold the same\n"
"kinds of items.\p"
"EGGS{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你没有参赛所需的\n"
"3只宝可梦。\p"
"要参赛，必须带上\n"
"3只不同种类的宝可梦。\p"
"这3只不同的宝可梦\n"
"等级都必须在50以下。\p"
"而且，它们也不能\n"
"携带同样的道具。\p"
"蛋{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:433
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_GuideYouToArena"
msgid ""
"I shall now guide you to\n"
"the BATTLE ARENA.$"
msgstr ""
"现在我带你去\n"
"对战竞技场。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:437
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_DidntSaveBeforeShuttingDown"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger!\p"
"You did not save the game before\n"
"shutting down, did you?\p"
"It is unfortunate, but that has\n"
"resulted in your disqualification\l"
"from your challenge.\p"
"You may, of course, start with a fresh\n"
"challenge.$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者！\p"
"你在关机之前\n"
"没有记录游戏进度吧？\p"
"很遗憾，因为这样，\n"
"你的挑战资格被取消了。\p"
"当然，你可以\n"
"重新开始挑战。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:447
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_CongratsOnSevenWins"
msgid ""
"We congratulate you for your splendid\n"
"string of wins over seven TRAINERS!$"
msgstr ""
"恭喜你精彩地\n"
"连续打败了7位训练家！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:451
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RecordAchievement"
msgid ""
"Your achievement will be recorded.\n"
"Please wait while I save the game.$"
msgstr ""
"你的成绩将会被记录下来。\n"
"我要记录游戏进度，请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:456
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_PresentYouWithPrize"
msgid ""
"In commemoration of your 7-win streak,\n"
"we present you with this prize.$"
msgstr ""
"为了纪念你的7连胜，\n"
"我们将这份奖品送给你。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:461
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ReceivedPrize"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} received the prize\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}得到了奖品\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:466
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_BagFullReturnForPrize"
msgid ""
"Oh?\n"
"Your BAG seems to be full.\p"
"I urge you to clear space and\n"
"return for your prize.$"
msgstr ""
"哦？\n"
"你的背包好像满了。\p"
"请腾出空间\n"
"再回来领取奖品。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:472
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ThankYouWaitWhileSave"
msgid ""
"Thank you so much for participating!\p"
"Please wait while I save the game.$"
msgstr ""
"非常感谢你的参与！\p"
"我要记录游戏进度，请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:476
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_AwaitAnotherChallenge2"
msgid ""
"We await your challenge on\n"
"another occasion!$"
msgstr "我们期待你下次的挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:480
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_LookingForwardToArrivalSaveGame"
msgid ""
"We have been looking forward to\n"
"your arrival.\p"
"Before I show you to the BATTLE\n"
"ARENA, I must save the game.\l"
"Please wait.$"
msgstr ""
"我们一直在期待你的到来。\p"
"带你去对战竞技场之前，\n"
"我必须先记录游戏进度。\l"
"请稍候。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:487
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RecordLastMatch"
msgid ""
"Shall I record your last BATTLE ARENA\n"
"match on your FRONTIER PASS?$"
msgstr ""
"要把你上一场对战竞技场的对战\n"
"录到开拓通行证里吗？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:491
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_BadIdeaToNotAttack"
msgid ""
"I lost on the REFEREE's decision…\p"
"I don't think it was a good idea to only\n"
"use defensive moves and not attack…$"
msgstr ""
"我在裁判判定中输了……\p"
"我觉得只用防御招式\n"
"不进攻，真不是个好主意……$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:496
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_LandingHitsWorked"
msgid ""
"I won in judging!\p"
"Landing hits consistently on\n"
"the opponent's POKéMON worked!$"
msgstr ""
"我在判定中赢了！\p"
"不断地命中对手的宝可梦\n"
"果然有效！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:501
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_MatchWasDeclaredDraw"
msgid ""
"Our match was declared a draw.\p"
"When we ran out of time, both my\n"
"POKéMON and the opponent's had about\l"
"the same amount of HP left.$"
msgstr ""
"我们的比赛被判为平局。\p"
"时间到的时候，我的宝可梦\n"
"和对手的宝可梦剩下的HP\l"
"差不多一样多。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:507
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_OrderOfMonsImportant"
msgid ""
"In the BATTLE ARENA, the order of\n"
"POKéMON is totally important.\p"
"For example, if your first POKéMON\n"
"has certain type disadvantages,\l"
"try making your second POKéMON one\l"
"with moves that are super effective\l"
"against the first one.\p"
"I think that will be a good way of\n"
"making an effective team.$"
msgstr ""
"在对战竞技场，\n"
"宝可梦的出场顺序非常重要。\p"
"比如说，如果你的第1只宝可梦\n"
"在属性上容易被克制，\l"
"那么第2只宝可梦最好带上\l"
"对克制它的对手\l"
"效果绝佳的招式。\p"
"我觉得这是组成\n"
"高效队伍的好方法。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:518
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_RulesAreListed"
msgid "The Set KO Tourney's rules are listed.$"
msgstr "上面列着淘汰赛的规则。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:521
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ReadWhichHeading"
msgid "Which heading do you want to read?$"
msgstr "你要阅读哪一项？$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:524
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainBattleRules"
msgid ""
"The Set KO Tourney has special rules,\n"
"unlike standard battles.\p"
"First, one battle lasts only\n"
"three turns.\p"
"If the outcome is not decided after\n"
"three turns, it goes to judging.\p"
"The REFEREE will choose the winner\n"
"based on how the POKéMON battled.\p"
"Also, a POKéMON cannot be switched out\n"
"until its battle's outcome is decided.$"
msgstr ""
"淘汰赛和普通的对战不同，\n"
"有特殊的规则。\p"
"首先，1场对战\n"
"只持续3回合。\p"
"如果3回合后还没有分出胜负，\n"
"就会进入判定。\p"
"裁判会根据宝可梦的\n"
"对战表现来选出胜者。\p"
"另外，在分出胜负之前，\n"
"宝可梦不能被换下场。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:536
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainMindRules"
msgid ""
"The first judging factor is “Mind.”\n"
"This factor evaluates how aggressive\l"
"the battlers were.\p"
"The judging is based on how often\n"
"the TRAINERS ordered the use of\l"
"offensive moves.$"
msgstr ""
"第1项判定标准是“心”。\n"
"这项标准评价的是\l"
"对战者有多积极。\p"
"判定的依据是训练家\n"
"指示使用攻击招式的频率。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:544
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainSkillRules"
msgid ""
"The second judging factor is “Skill.”\n"
"This factor evaluates how effectively\l"
"POKéMON moves were used.\p"
"If a move worked successfully,\n"
"the Skill rating goes up.\p"
"If a move failed, the Skill rating\n"
"is lowered.\p"
"If it was an offensive move, the Skill\n"
"rating goes up if the move was “super\l"
"effective” and goes down if it was\l"
"“not very effective.”\p"
"The Skill rating will not go up for\n"
"moves such as PROTECT and DETECT.\p"
"If the opponent used PROTECT or\n"
"DETECT, and your POKéMON failed to\l"
"hit with a move, its Skill rating will not\l"
"go down.$"
msgstr ""
"第2项判定标准是“技”。\n"
"这项标准评价的是\l"
"宝可梦的招式用得有多有效。\p"
"如果招式成功了，\n"
"“技”的评价就会提高。\p"
"如果招式失败了，\n"
"“技”的评价就会降低。\p"
"如果是攻击招式，\n"
"“效果绝佳”时评价会提高，\l"
"“效果不好”时评价会降低。\p"
"使用守住和看穿等招式，\n"
"“技”的评价不会提高。\p"
"如果对手使用了守住或看穿，\n"
"导致你的宝可梦的招式没有命中，\l"
"“技”的评价不会降低。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:563
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_ExplainBodyRules"
msgid ""
"The third judging factor is “Body.”\n"
"This factor is based on how much HP\l"
"remained at the end of a battle.\p"
"The rating takes into account how much\n"
"HP a POKéMON had at the start of\l"
"battle, and what remained at the end.$"
msgstr ""
"第3项判定标准是“体”。\n"
"这项标准的依据是\l"
"对战结束时剩余的HP。\p"
"评价时会考虑宝可梦\n"
"在对战开始时的HP\l"
"和结束时剩下的HP。$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:571
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_CongratsOnDefeatingTycoon"
msgid ""
"A victory snatched from the ARENA\n"
"TYCOON, and a seven-TRAINER sweep!\p"
"We congratulate you on your most\n"
"splendid challenge!$"
msgstr ""
"从竞技场大亨手中夺得胜利，\n"
"还横扫了7位训练家！\p"
"恭喜你完成了\n"
"最精彩的挑战！$"

#: data/maps/BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby/scripts.inc:577
msgctxt "BattleFrontier_BattleArenaLobby_Text_PleaseAcceptBattlePoints"
msgid ""
"My dear challenger, in recognition of\n"
"your indefatigable spirit, please\l"
"accept these Battle Point(s).$"
msgstr ""
"亲爱的挑战者，为了表彰你\n"
"不屈不挠的精神，\l"
"请收下这些对战点数。$"
